# `@as ... via fn` names a function of the @lang module.
# error: as_via_no_lang.grammar:17:21:
# error: the grammar has no @lang
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser

program! = items                            → (program ...1)
items    = item                             → (1)
         | items item                       → (...1 2)
@as IDENT = [go via findGo]
item     = go
         | IDENT                            → (name 1)
go       = GO                               → (go 1)
